                    .author("testAgent")
                    .build();
            largeEventList.add(event);
        }
        agent.setEventsToEmit(largeEventList);
        Flowable<Event> result = agent.runAsyncImpl(invocationContext);
        TestSubscriber<Event> testSubscriber = result.test();
        testSubscriber.awaitDone(10, TimeUnit.SECONDS);
        testSubscriber.assertComplete();
        testSubscriber.assertNoErrors();
        testSubscriber.assertValueCount(1000);
    }
    @Test
    @Tag("invalid")
    public void runAsyncImplWithNullAgentInContext() {
        ConcreteAgent agent = new ConcreteAgent("testAgent", "Test agent description");
        
        InvocationContext contextWithNullAgent = InvocationContext.builder()
                .sessionService(sessionService)
                .artifactService(artifactService)
                .memoryService(memoryService)
                .pluginManager(pluginManager)
                .invocationId("test-invocation-id")
                .agent(null)
                .session(session)
                .runConfig(runConfig)
                .build();
        Event mockEvent = Event.builder()
                .id("event-1")
                .invocationId("test-invocation-id")
                .author("testAgent")
                .build();
        agent.setEventsToEmit(ImmutableList.of(mockEvent));
        Flowable<Event> result = agent.runAsyncImpl(contextWithNullAgent);
        TestSubscriber<Event> testSubscriber = result.test();
        testSubscriber.awaitDone(5, TimeUnit.SECONDS);
        testSubscriber.assertComplete();
    }
    @Test
    @Tag("boundary")
    @Timeout(value = 10, unit = TimeUnit.SECONDS)
    public void runAsyncImplReturnsNeverCompletingFlowable() {
        NeverCompletingAgent agent = new NeverCompletingAgent("neverAgent", "Never completing agent");
        invocationContext = createValidInvocationContext(agent);
        Flowable<Event> result = agent.runAsyncImpl(invocationContext);
        TestSubscriber<Event> testSubscriber = result
                .take(3)
                .test();
        testSubscriber.awaitDone(5, TimeUnit.SECONDS);
        testSubscriber.assertValueCount(3);
        testSubscriber.assertComplete();
    }
    @Test
    @Tag("valid")
    public void runAsyncImplUsesCustomInvocationId() {
        ConcreteAgent agent = new ConcreteAgent("testAgent", "Test agent description");
        
        String customInvocationId = "test-invocation-123";
        InvocationContext contextWithCustomId = InvocationContext.builder()
                .sessionService(sessionService)
                .artifactService(artifactService)
                .memoryService(memoryService)
                .pluginManager(pluginManager)
                .invocationId(customInvocationId)
                .agent(agent)
                .session(session)
                .runConfig(runConfig)
                .build();
        Event mockEvent = Event.builder()
                .id("event-1")
                .invocationId(customInvocationId)
                .author("testAgent")
                .build();
        agent.setEventsToEmit(ImmutableList.of(mockEvent));
        Flowable<Event> result = agent.runAsyncImpl(contextWithCustomId);
        TestSubscriber<Event> testSubscriber = result.test();
        testSubscriber.awaitDone(5, TimeUnit.SECONDS);
        testSubscriber.assertComplete();
        testSubscriber.assertNoErrors();
        testSubscriber.assertValue(event -> 
            event.invocationId().equals(customInvocationId));
    }
    @Test
    @Tag("invalid")
    public void runAsyncImplThrowsExceptionDuringFlowableCreation() {
        ExceptionThrowingAgent agent = new ExceptionThrowingAgent("exceptionAgent", "Exception throwing agent");
        invocationContext = createValidInvocationContext(agent);
        assertThrows(IllegalArgumentException.class, () -> {
            agent.runAsyncImpl(invocationContext);
        });
    }
    // Concrete test implementations
    private static class ConcreteAgent extends BaseAgent {
        private List<Event> eventsToEmit = ImmutableList.of();
        public ConcreteAgent(String name, String description) {
            super(name, description, ImmutableList.of(), null, null);
        }
        public void setEventsToEmit(List<Event> events) {
            this.eventsToEmit = events;
        }
        @Override
        protected Flowable<Event> runAsyncImpl(InvocationContext invocationContext) {
            if (invocationContext.endInvocation()) {
                return Flowable.empty();
            }
            return Flowable.fromIterable(eventsToEmit);
        }
        @Override
        protected Flowable<Event> runLiveImpl(InvocationContext invocationContext) {
            return Flowable.empty();
        }
    }
    private static class ErrorEmittingAgent extends BaseAgent {
        private List<Event> eventsToEmit = ImmutableList.of();
        private String errorMessage;
        public ErrorEmittingAgent(String name, String description) {
            super(name, description, ImmutableList.of(), null, null);
        }
        public void setEventsToEmit(List<Event> events) {
            this.eventsToEmit = events;
        }
        public void setErrorMessage(String message) {
            this.errorMessage = message;
        }
        @Override
        protected Flowable<Event> runAsyncImpl(InvocationContext invocationContext) {
            return Flowable.fromIterable(eventsToEmit)
                    .concatWith(Flowable.error(new RuntimeException(errorMessage)));
        }
        @Override
        protected Flowable<Event> runLiveImpl(InvocationContext invocationContext) {
            return Flowable.empty();
        }
    }
    private static class DelayedEmissionAgent extends BaseAgent {
        private List<Event> eventsToEmit = ImmutableList.of();
        private final TestScheduler scheduler;
        public DelayedEmissionAgent(String name, String description, TestScheduler scheduler) {
            super(name, description, ImmutableList.of(), null, null);
            this.scheduler = scheduler;
        }
        public void setEventsToEmit(List<Event> events) {
            this.eventsToEmit = events;
        }
        @Override
        protected Flowable<Event> runAsyncImpl(InvocationContext invocationContext) {
            AtomicInteger index = new AtomicInteger(0);
            return Flowable.interval(1, TimeUnit.SECONDS, scheduler)
                    .take(eventsToEmit.size())
                    .map(tick -> eventsToEmit.get(index.getAndIncrement()));
        }
        @Override
        protected Flowable<Event> runLiveImpl(InvocationContext invocationContext) {
            return Flowable.empty();
        }
    }
    private static class NeverCompletingAgent extends BaseAgent {
        public NeverCompletingAgent(String name, String description) {
            super(name, description, ImmutableList.of(), null, null);
        }
        @Override
        protected Flowable<Event> runAsyncImpl(InvocationContext invocationContext) {
            return Flowable.interval(100, TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS)
                    .map(tick -> Event.builder()
                            .id("event-" + tick)
                            .invocationId(invocationContext.invocationId())
                            .author(name())
                            .build());
        }
        @Override
        protected Flowable<Event> runLiveImpl(InvocationContext invocationContext) {
            return Flowable.empty();
        }
    }
    private static class ExceptionThrowingAgent extends BaseAgent {
        public ExceptionThrowingAgent(String name, String description) {
            super(name, description, ImmutableList.of(), null, null);
        }
        @Override
        protected Flowable<Event> runAsyncImpl(InvocationContext invocationContext) {
            throw new IllegalArgumentException("Invalid invocation context");
        }
        @Override
        protected Flowable<Event> runLiveImpl(InvocationContext invocationContext) {
            return Flowable.empty();
        }
    }
}